        "id": 222566,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-27T23:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just noticed when transcribing for the wiki:</p>\n<p>Voss's back side flavor text: \"Witness true power! Now begins the subjugation of all the <strong>Multiverse</strong>!\"</p>\n<p>First thing he does after claiming OblivAeon's power: Shuts himself off from the rest of the multiverse.</p>\n<p>Some of the other flavor text is messed up, too.&nbsp; Tempest's quote where he flings Empyreon into space is in Scion Strike #1, for instance, but the story C&amp;A told put it way later than that.&nbsp; And the quote on Faultless's card is from Scion Strike #5, far too late (Dark Mind's flip side's quote is from Scion Strike #3 and Borr's explosion is in #4).</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
