      {
        "id": 222576,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-05T18:11:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TheBazaarClerk\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thebazaarclerk/48/2156_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheBazaarClerk:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This episode biggest surprise: I actually liked seeing Guise and I’m interested in what happens to the character. I’m glad they are toning down the wackiness and doing away with the meta gimmick.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If you don’t love him at his ‘worst’ then you don’t deserve him at his best.</p>",
